@rileybrown Building and testing a game is a lot of work. I don't see a lot of people doing this.

I see random people doing this just because it's new and novel. 

That's not going to be relevant as we move forward. People want curated experiences where they don't have to do all the work.

@Soumyacatalyst Hey! So I don't do paid posts. 

I am an investor (through the firm I work for, @a16z) in some of the companies I post about - those are tagged in my bio.

I also post about products that we haven't invested in and try to give an honest view of what each model is good at 😊
